1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,140
Two mornings. One with condensation, one without. Fog inside the glass, same morning, same cloth.

2
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:08,160
The cover clamps outside, in the door frame, not the glass.

3
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,360
Next morning, no condensation to wipe off.

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,320
The flaps hold in wind all night.

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:16,560
No more wiping condensation every morning.
